flowchart TD
    Start([PR Created / Synchronize]) --> Gate[1. PR Gatekeepers\n- Branch name check\n- PR template check]
    
    Gate -->|Pass| ParallelRuns{Parallel CI Execution}
    Gate -->|Fail| BlockGate[❌ CI Halted / PR Blocked\nNo further checks run]

    subgraph FastValidation [Fast Feedback]
        ParallelRuns --> Lint[2. Linters & Formatters\n- Prettier, ESLint, Style]
    end

    subgraph SecurityScan [GHAS Security - Dedicated]
        ParallelRuns --> Sec[3. Security & Quality\n- Secret Scanning\n- CodeQL SAST\n- Dependabot]
    end

    subgraph TestCoverage [Test & Coverage Gate]
        ParallelRuns --> Test[4. Automated Tests & Coverage]
    end

    subgraph DocGate [Documentation Gate]
        ParallelRuns --> DocCheck[5. Doc Drift & TypeCheck]
    end

    %% Test failure loop
    Test -->|< 80% Coverage| CovFail[Exit 1: Output uncovered lines\nApply label: 'test-required']
    CovFail --> AgentTest[🤖 Copilot Agent Workflow\nTrigger: PR labeled 'test-required']
    AgentTest --> LoadTestPrompt[Load .github/prompts/unit-test-coverage.prompt.md]
    LoadTestPrompt --> RunCopilotTest[Copilot CLI / Agent generates tests\nPushes commit to PR branch]
    RunCopilotTest --> RemoveTestLabel[Remove 'test-required' label]
    RemoveTestLabel --> Start

    %% Doc failure loop
    DocCheck -->|Docs Missing| DocFail[Exit 1: Report missing docs\nApply label: 'docs-required']
    DocFail --> AgentDoc[🤖 PR Documentation Updater\nTrigger: PR labeled 'docs-required']
    AgentDoc --> RunCopilotDoc[Copilot analyzes diff & APIs\nDrafts Markdown guides & examples\nOpens Stacked Remediation PR]
    RunCopilotDoc --> DevMergeDoc[Developer Reviews & Merges Stacked PR]
    DevMergeDoc --> Start

    %% Success path
    Lint -->|Pass| GateCheck{All Passed?}
    Sec -->|Pass| GateCheck
    Test -->|>= 80% Coverage| GateCheck
    DocCheck -->|Pass| GateCheck

    GateCheck -->|Yes| AICodeReview[6. GitHub Copilot Code Review\nAI architectural / diff review]
    AICodeReview --> HumanReview[7. Human Code Review & Approval]
    HumanReview --> Merge([🚀 Merge PR])
